      "content": "\"small steps\" and \"joy\"... it just feels like you're suggesting i put a band-aid on a gaping wound. what's the point of \"navigating the days ahead\" when every day is just going to be this emptiness? it feels like i'm just dragging a heavy weight around for no reason. sometimes i look at the empty spot on the rug and i just think... why am i even still here? it's like the universe is already empty, and i'm just the last piece of nothing left to clear out.",
